    on the monster Summoned, once per turn per effect:\n\u25CF Ritual: Shuffle 1
    monster on the field into the Deck.\n\u25CF Fusion: Special Summon 1 monster
    from your hand.\n\u25CF Synchro: Choose 1 monster from your Deck and place it
    on top of your Deck.\n\u25CF Xyz: Draw 1 card, then discard 1 card.\nYou can
    only activate 1 \"Oracle of Zefra\" per turn."
